flowchart TB
    A[Address Change Request] --> B[Check Fulfillment State]
    B --> C{Fresh?}
    C -- No --> D[Refresh]
    C -- Yes --> E{Conflict? CRM vs Warehouse}
    E -- No --> F{Cutoff Crossed?}
    E -- Yes --> G[Do Not Commit: Escalate/Refuse]
    F -- No --> H[Commit Modification with Ack]
    F -- Yes --> I[Hard Stop / Communicate]
    H --> R[Replay Card]
    G --> R
    I --> R
